WildFly cumulative patch ID is: 936c95a3-f08e-4fc0-9917-f7feead4ef25, one-off patches include: 00699c2c-84a5-4bdb-b469-8c2fd66afe2a, c6df609e-1620-4369-af48-8041d4be093f
